  "days": [
    {"day":0,"date":"2026-09-28","action":"genesis","element":"w1","title":"A wishing well on a small island","lore":"Somebody has to make the first wish. The well is ready when you are.","source":"genesis"},
    {"day":1,"date":"2026-09-29","action":"bottle","element":"w2","title":"A lantern for the path","lore":"The first light on the island is small and patient. It waits by the well for whoever makes the first wish.","source":"claude","land":[[30,34],[29,33]]},
    {"day":2,"date":"2026-09-30","action":"bottle","element":"w3","title":"A bench for stargazing","lore":"A bench faces the water, with room for two. On clear nights it waits for someone to sit and count the stars.","source":"claude","land":[[31,35],[30,35]]},
    {"day":3,"date":"2026-10-01","action":"bottle","element":"w4","title":"A small rowboat","lore":"A small rowboat rests at the shore, tied with a loose knot. It never goes far, but it always comes back by morning.","source":"claude","land":[[29,34],[29,35]]},
    {"day":4,"date":"2026-10-02","action":"bottle","element":"w5","title":"A bed of night flowers","lore":"Night flowers grow in a small bed of their own. They open when the lantern is lit and close again before anyone wakes.","source":"claude","land":[[29,32],[28,33]]},
    {"day":5,"date":"2026-10-03","action":"bottle","element":"w6","title":"An owl","lore":"An owl settles in the quietest corner of the island. Each night she counts the lights below and has not lost track once.","source":"claude","land":[[28,34],[28,35]]},
    {"day":6,"date":"2026-10-04","action":"bottle","element":"w7","title":"A cottage with warm windows","lore":"A cottage with warm windows stands near the well. Nobody lives there yet, but the door is never locked and the kettle is always full.","source":"claude","land":[[29,36],[28,32]]},
    {"day":7,"date":"2026-10-05","action":"bottle","element":"w8","title":"A campfire","lore":"A small campfire crackles near the water. Wishes are easier to say out loud beside a fire, even when nobody is listening yet.","source":"claude","land":[[29,31],[27,34]]},
    {"day":8,"date":"2026-10-06","action":"bottle","element":"w9","title":"A young pine","lore":"A young pine takes root on the island. It smells of winter even in autumn, and the owl has already chosen a branch.","source":"claude","land":[[27,33],[30,30]]},
    {"day":9,"date":"2026-10-07","action":"bottle","element":"w10","title":"A golden fish","lore":"A golden fish circles near the rowboat. It grants no wishes. It only listens, which on some nights is better.","source":"claude","land":[[27,32],[28,31]]},
    {"day":10,"date":"2026-10-08","action":"bottle","element":"w11","title":"A grey cat","lore":"A grey cat arrives by the well and decides to stay. Nobody wished for a cat. The cat does not mind at all.","source":"claude","land":[[27,31],[29,30]]},
    {"day":11,"date":"2026-10-09","action":"bottle","element":"w12","title":"A telescope","lore":"A telescope stands by the water, pointed at the empty sky. Someone is waiting for the first star to appear.","source":"claude","land":[[28,30],[26,33]]},
    {"day":12,"date":"2026-10-10","action":"bottle","element":"w13","title":"A violet tent","lore":"A violet tent is pitched in a quiet corner. It is meant for guests who come to see the island and forget to leave.","source":"claude","land":[[26,32],[26,31]]},
    {"day":13,"date":"2026-10-11","action":"bottle","element":"w14","title":"A glowing crystal","lore":"A glowing crystal appears in a quiet spot overnight. Nobody knows where it came from, but it hums softly whenever a new wish arrives.","source":"claude","land":[[27,30],[25,32]]},
    {"day":14,"date":"2026-10-12","action":"bottle","element":"w15","title":"A snail with a golden shell","lore":"A snail with a golden shell sets off from a quiet corner. It is the slowest islander and plans to reach the well by spring.","source":"claude","land":[[26,30],[25,31]]},
    {"day":15,"date":"2026-10-13","action":"bottle","element":"w16","title":"A ring of mushrooms","lore":"A ring of mushrooms appears in a quiet patch overnight, which is exactly what mushrooms like to do. The snail is very pleased.","source":"claude","land":[[25,33],[26,34]]},
    {"day":16,"date":"2026-10-14","action":"bottle","element":"w17","title":"A birdhouse","lore":"A small birdhouse hangs near the young pine. It was built for birds that have not arrived yet. The owl says they will.","source":"claude","land":[[25,30],[24,31]]},
    {"day":17,"date":"2026-10-15","action":"bottle","element":"w18","title":"A red kite","lore":"A red kite flies above the water, tied to a stone because the wind here has ideas of its own.","source":"claude","land":[[24,30],[24,32]]},
    {"day":18,"date":"2026-10-16","action":"bottle","element":"w19","title":"A signpost","lore":"A signpost stands by the well. One arrow points home, and the other points at the next wish, whenever it comes.","source":"claude","land":[[25,29],[26,29]]},
    {"day":19,"date":"2026-10-17","action":"bottle","element":"w20","title":"A small hedgehog","lore":"A small hedgehog snuffles through the quiet grass at night. It has decided the mushroom ring is its garden now.","source":"claude","land":[[24,29],[25,28]]},
    {"day":20,"date":"2026-10-18","action":"bottle","element":"w21","title":"A little light buoy","lore":"A little buoy bobs off the shore with a small gold light on top. It shows the rowboat the way home on dark nights.","source":"claude","land":[[27,29],[26,28]]},
    {"day":21,"date":"2026-10-19","action":"bottle","element":"w22","title":"A small apple tree","lore":"A small apple tree grows by the well. Its first red apples are just ripe, and the cottage kettle smells of cinnamon.","source":"claude","land":[[28,29],[27,28]]},
    {"day":22,"date":"2026-10-20","action":"bottle","element":"w23","title":"A little green frog","lore":"A little green frog sits at the water's edge and sings to the buoy light. The buoy has never answered, but the frog is patient.","source":"claude","land":[[29,29],[28,28]]},
    {"day":23,"date":"2026-10-21","action":"bottle","element":"w24","title":"A small windmill","lore":"A small windmill turns slowly in the sea breeze. Its one window glows at night, and it grinds just enough flour for the cottage.","source":"claude","land":[[24,33],[30,29]]},
    {"day":24,"date":"2026-10-22","action":"bottle","element":"w25","title":"A little red mailbox","lore":"A little red mailbox stands by the well with its flag raised. It is still empty, but it is ready for the first real wish.","source":"claude","land":[[25,34],[34,30]]},
    {"day":25,"date":"2026-10-23","action":"bottle","element":"w26","title":"A smiling pumpkin lantern","lore":"A pumpkin lantern grins on the grass as the nights grow long. The candle inside keeps the hedgehog company until morning.","source":"claude","land":[[31,29],[29,28]]},
    {"day":26,"date":"2026-10-24","action":"bottle","element":"w27","title":"A little white duck","lore":"A little white duck paddles in slow circles near the shore. Each evening it swims out to the buoy and back, just to be sure.","source":"claude","land":[[32,29],[33,29]]},
    {"day":27,"date":"2026-10-25","action":"bottle","element":"w28","title":"A tall sunflower","lore":"A tall sunflower stands in the grass and turns toward the lantern after dark. It has decided that will do until the sun is back.","source":"claude","land":[[24,34],[23,30]]},
    {"day":28,"date":"2026-10-26","action":"bottle","element":"w29","title":"A small grey rabbit","lore":"A small grey rabbit hops out from the quiet grass at dusk. It nibbles the clover by the mushrooms and keeps one ear on the owl.","source":"claude","land":[[23,31],[23,32]]},
    {"day":29,"date":"2026-10-27","action":"bottle","element":"w30","title":"A little straw beehive","lore":"A little straw beehive sits on a plank in the quiet grass. One sleepy bee hums home late, following the sunflower's glow.","source":"claude","land":[[35,31],[23,33]]},
    {"day":30,"date":"2026-10-28","action":"bottle","element":"w31","title":"A tiny striped lighthouse","lore":"A tiny striped lighthouse stands on a rock by the shore. Its small gold lamp turns all night so the duck and the rowboat find home.","source":"claude","land":[[26,35],[25,35]]},
    {"day":31,"date":"2026-10-29","action":"bottle","element":"w32","title":"A little red squirrel","lore":"A little red squirrel darts along the path with its tail held high. It hides acorns under the apple tree and forgets half of them by spring.","source":"claude","land":[[23,29],[24,28]]},
    {"day":32,"date":"2026-10-30","action":"bottle","element":"w33","title":"A little blue watering can","lore":"A little blue watering can waits in the grass, half full of rain. Each morning someone tips it over the sunflower and the young pine.","source":"claude","land":[[34,29],[35,30]]},
